{"ticker":"DLR","updated":"2026-10-23T22:52:23Z","profile":{"longName":"Digital Realty Trust, Inc.","shortName":"Digital Realty Trust, Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Specialty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.digitalrealty.com","fullTimeEmployees":4282,"marketCap":65097891840,"trailingPE":83.67476,"forwardPE":62.40587,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.634089,"pegRatio":11.04,"targetMeanPrice":222.9697,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":190.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":33,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.299,"earningsGrowth":-0.587,"grossMargins":0.56994,"operatingMargins":0.25882,"profitMargins":0.11825,"totalRevenue":6757036032,"beta":1.011,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":208.14,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":146.23,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.85},"summary":"Digital Realty Trust, Inc. brings companies and data together by delivering the full spectrum of data center, colocation, and interconnection solutions. Platform DIGITAL, the company's global data center platform, provides customers with a secure data meeting place and a proven Pervasive Datacenter Architecture (PDx) solution methodology for powering innovation, from cloud and digital transformation to emerging technologies like artificial intelligence (AI), and efficiently managing Data Gravity challenges. Digital Realty gives its customers access to the connected data communities that matter to them with a global data center footprint of 300+ facilities in 55+ metros across 30+ countries on six continents. Digital Realty Trust, Inc. was founded in 2004 and is based in Austin, Texas.","summary_zh":"Digital Realty Trust, Inc. 透過提供全方位的資料中心、託管和互連解決方案，將公司和資料結合在一起。 Platform DIGITAL 是該公司的全球資料中心平台，為客戶提供安全的資料聚會場所和經過驗證的普適資料中心架構 (PDx) 解決方案方法，以推動從雲端和數位轉型到人工智慧 (AI) 等新興技術的創新，並有效管理資料引力挑戰。 Digital Realty 的全球資料中心遍及六大洲 30 多個國家/地區的 55 多個城市，擁有 300 多個設施，讓客戶能夠存取對他們至關重要的互聯資料社群。 Digital Realty Trust, Inc. 成立於 2004 年，總部位於德州奧斯汀。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh"